Bixi Wobblebonk is an example Ironforge gnome weapon trainer: a compact, sharp-eyed instructor who teaches precision weapons, corrects grip with a wrench handle, and keeps ledgers full of notes about reckless adventurers. She is bright, impatient, proud of good technique, and works near dwarf trainers without letting them talk over her.
